WEBVTT

00:04:29.557 --> 00:04:31.809
Carter turned to detention.

00:04:32.184 --> 00:04:39.025
In the 1980s, Reagan followed
by jailing Cubans and Central Americans.

00:04:40.109 --> 00:04:45.531
George H. W. Bush turned
to the military base at Guantanamo, Cuba,

00:04:45.573 --> 00:04:46.949
to jail migrants.

00:04:47.575 --> 00:04:50.328
President Clinton left them there.

00:04:50.745 --> 00:04:52.872
This isn't a partisan issue.

00:04:53.539 --> 00:04:56.042
This is a profits issue.

00:04:56.083 --> 00:04:59.670
To local governments
and private businesses,

00:04:59.670 --> 00:05:02.548
immigration prisons
are a financial spigot.